  "notes": [
    "The tolerance and minimum cell count were registered in the protocol commit named under protocolRef before any reference grid for this parameter set was generated, and are unchanged.",
    "Scope is measured cells only. Interpolated (IDW fill) cells are not covered: rasterizeDtm does not fill.",
    "OLV is given only the cell size; rasterizeDtm builds the grid from the data minimum. The reference is given the same origin and extent computed by that rule. Every input is shifted by (+0.37, +0.61) m so the origin is off the integer lattice.",
    "7677 cells that share an interior edge on which an input return lies were left out of every leg, as the protocol fixed in advance. That is an edge convention, not a median question.",
    "The numbers are computed by tests/dtmMedianCrossCheck.test.ts."
